  message: "OWNER-APPROVED PLAN 2026-09-29: (1) per-zone coverage gate -- a claim on code_execution or dom_injection is inconclusive for any language present in the repo that has no sink in that zone (INV-potu's rule per zone); (2) while WI-bonah's shapes are unreached, a clean JS/TS verdict on these zones is confirmed_with_caveats naming the unseen shapes, never plain confirmed; (3) deserialization (pickle.loads, yaml.load, ObjectInputStream, Marshal) is NOT folded into code_execution -- a separate zone only if the owner asks. Then WI-bonah."  # 89da
